commit 385bfb56110cf5dfc993b2ee9b40a5a229532370

C03: the private memory parser accepts «recordá/acordate que me llamo …», «quiero que me recuerdes como …» and «recordá … color favorito» (MEMORY1245 repair)

«Quiero que me recuerdes como red» (H0149) had no memory route and the mind
read it as a reminder without a time; the voseo «recordá que me llamo …» and
«recordá que mi color favorito es …» had none either. The name and favourite
colour save patterns now admit those heads; nothing else in the private
channel changes. No tests (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


